# Normalize line endings to LF regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf setting.
# Without this, a Windows clone checks files out as CRLF while the committed blobs (and
# Prettier's default) are LF, making `npm run quality` report every text file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.svg binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
